; windtrap_coverage is the coverage seam's data source: the runner
; snapshots in-process coverage at run end for the inline summary.
; windtrap_mutate is the mutation seam's: Render spells mutant
; identifiers and the arming variable with the runtime's own functions,
; so the report and the runtime cannot disagree about what to type. Both
; dependencies point downward only — neither runtime links windtrap.

(library
 (name windtrap)
 (public_name windtrap)
 (libraries unix clock windtrap_coverage windtrap_mutate)
 (foreign_stubs
  (language c)
  (names capture_stubs)))
